00:14:47.176 --> 00:14:49.790
then that's not going to
give you the right subspace.

00:14:49.791 --> 00:14:53.050
What I mean by that, is the angle

00:14:53.051 --> 00:14:56.780
between the subspace
that you get from M.P,

00:14:56.781 --> 00:14:59.715
again this is like the
expectation that you observe,

00:14:59.716 --> 00:15:02.100
and the true subspace the angle

00:15:02.101 --> 00:15:04.755
between these substances is
ninety degrees 90 degrees.

00:15:04.756 --> 00:15:06.390
They're actually
orthogonal to each other.

00:15:06.391 --> 00:15:10.245
So, these together are bad news.

00:15:10.246 --> 00:15:12.700
Essentially says you have

00:15:12.701 --> 00:15:15.055
