00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:21.180
If you start from a random point,

00:15:21.181 --> 00:15:24.580
then you may end up in one
of these bad local optima,

00:15:24.581 --> 00:15:26.650
as essentially induced by

00:15:26.651 --> 00:15:28.770
