00:29:03.611 --> 00:29:05.690
But now, you need to take into

00:29:05.691 --> 00:29:08.560
consideration like how close
this is to identity, right?

00:29:08.561 --> 00:29:10.260
Basically, you cannot hope

00:29:10.261 --> 00:29:12.885
that these barriers would
events at the same rate,

00:29:12.886 --> 00:29:16.200
because you're underlying
solutions not identity, right?

00:29:16.201 --> 00:29:17.920
So, but, it's not very

00:29:17.921 --> 00:29:20.155
