00:41:17.051 --> 00:41:19.240
I know the question is yes.

00:41:19.241 --> 00:41:22.480
I know one other problem
that you can apply this to.

00:41:22.481 --> 00:41:25.165
I'm pretty sure there
are plenty more,

00:41:25.166 --> 00:41:26.930
I mean, it's just
